素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_051_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そういうってことは、認めるってことですか？」","title":"シーン 51","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第51スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.051.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.48,"id":"02101EA5-9E69-411A-9052-14BDF4CD9E91","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_052_射命丸文.wav","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「ええ…」私はそう言いかけ、ハッとする。","title":"シーン 52","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","slideTitle":"第52スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.052.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.971587301587301,"id":"8BA7F473-9969-4797-AE6D-9DADFABE0980","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_053_博麗霊夢.wav","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「言わなくても、あんたなら分かるわよね…」","title":"シーン 53","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","slideTitle":"第53スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.053.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.031995464852607,"id":"FFC674A2-3CB7-4A46-9E79-0990F54B3C97","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_054_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、そうです…とでも言っておきましょうか…」","title":"シーン 54","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第54スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.054.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.064761904761904,"id":"B804DE6C-843C-4A57-9604-7BF3B471F7E5","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3,"animationName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","telop":"それから皆で家に戻り…","title":"シーン 55","voiceCharacter":"ナレーション","slideTitle":"第55スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.055.jpeg","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","id":"6EA9A160-3058-40A8-B312-3D55F8B7186C","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_056_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちが文と別れ、家に帰ってくると、共同スペースには、夕陽が差し込んでいた。そして、各々が自分の部屋に向かう。","title":"シーン 56","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第56スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.056.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.569115646258503,"id":"38239AAB-50CF-4276-8A32-63BFA285F226","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_057_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、自分の部屋に戻ってくると、ふとこれからのことを考える。もし、彼女たちから一人だけ選ぶなら誰にしようか…と。","title":"シーン 57","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第57スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.057.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.890861678004535,"id":"B2C56261-7623-449E-9CA1-6FB2224DAC99","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_058_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"今は、まだ包括的婚約の制度があるから、問題は起きないが、紫と結んだ条件には包括的婚約は廃止と記載した。","title":"シーン 58","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第58スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.058.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.60390022675737,"id":"FCA12DAF-C33A-41A7-9296-3383FFA24E1F","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_059_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、これまで、数多の優遇措置も無くなる。\nそして、僕は、彼女たちの中から、一人だけ選ぶことになる。","title":"シーン 59","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第59スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.059.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.93,"id":"F1D37168-6F7B-427C-AACA-6B63F729CB41","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_060_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そんなことを考えていると、ポケベルが光る。\nそこには、フランからのメッセージだった。","title":"シーン 60","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第60スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.060.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.413673469387755,"id":"171207E6-CAC1-4A23-8840-B731BDEB681F","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.2,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_061_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「わざわざ、メッセージを送らずに、直接来ればいいのに…」\n僕は、そう呟きながら、部屋を出て、玄関に向かう。","title":"シーン 61","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第61スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.061.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.322380952380953,"id":"3BBA66A2-36A0-45F0-90BF-75F442B40C11","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_062_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、フランの部屋の入り口に来ると、インターホンを鳴らす。","title":"シーン 62","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第62スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.062.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.918027210884354,"id":"8781EFBD-D3C0-4CEF-9BD2-1255E7F2F66A","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc254861_マンションの外廊下（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_063_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「一緒に、部屋の中に入ろうよ、操夢。」\n私は、そう言いながら、彼を部屋に招く。","title":"シーン 63","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","slideTitle":"第63スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.063.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.7394784580498865,"id":"5B2901B4-4056-4869-A56F-594376AD191D","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc254861_マンションの外廊下（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_064_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「ねぇ、操夢…、飛行機の中で、包括的婚約が廃止されるってニュース見たんだけど…、それって本当なの？」","title":"シーン 64","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","slideTitle":"第64スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.064.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.269478458049887,"id":"EBA7A52A-6ED8-4BAB-9DC6-020382341CBD","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_065_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ええ、そうですよ。僕が、提示した条件に、含まれていたし、彼女も、いずれ廃止する予定だったと言ってましたから。」","title":"シーン 65","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第65スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.065.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.714761904761905,"id":"D7BFA84F-17EF-4946-80EF-8B0E8FA059A3","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_066_博麗霊夢.wav","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「そう…」","title":"シーン 66","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","slideTitle":"第66スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.066.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.241995464852607,"id":"E74060E4-F63F-47C2-B546-19885C81CDE9","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_067_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それで、それがどうかしたんですか…？」","title":"シーン 67","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第67スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.067.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.227823129251701,"id":"AAA371D9-2395-4FD9-B0A9-831F84EB9443","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":6.1000000000000005,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_068_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「お姉様が言ってたんだけど、私たちは、その制度がなくなるなら、実家に戻るって…」私は、言いたいことを言えずにそう話す。","title":"シーン 68","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","slideTitle":"第68スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.068.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.331995464852607,"id":"48A068CB-6500-4D6B-8D83-93A2DE4B27F9","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_069_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「…、フランさんは、僕が誰かを選ぶなら…、いや、この質問は控えた方がいいですね…それで他には？」","title":"シーン 69","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第69スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.069.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.83,"id":"A7887C31-D59A-4279-B5B8-9594B36D2D89","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_070_古明地さとり.wav","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「私は…、それより、久々に血を飲ませてくれない？」","title":"シーン 70","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","slideTitle":"第70スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.070.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.1411791383219954,"id":"5B2764E5-E585-467D-81BF-64B66E31F1FF","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_071_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「いいですよ。」僕はそう言うと、そっと彼女に背を向ける。\nすると、彼女がゆっくりと噛みつき、僕の血を吸い始める。","title":"シーン 71","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第71スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.071.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.508253968253968,"id":"BF6977ED-1811-4332-ABF6-4C2923FA8462","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_072_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、吸い終わると、僕は、ゆっくりと振り返り、彼女を見る。\n「それで、僕をここに呼んだ理由は…」","title":"シーン 72","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第72スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.072.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.020204081632652,"id":"63E7029F-C41D-495E-BA59-DB1BA2019C52","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_073_操夢.wav","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「操夢…私と…」","title":"シーン 73","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","slideTitle":"第73スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.073.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.119115646258503,"id":"73DA4C99-FCE9-44C4-BF4A-458A3750E8A8","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":4.1000000000000005,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_074_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「少しだけ、待っててもらえませんか、その返事…」\n僕は、予想通りの言葉に、そう返す。","title":"シーン 74","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第74スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.074.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.181065759637188,"id":"BD8739AD-67B6-42A1-871C-B59DDD67FFE7","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_075_ナレーション.wav","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「分かった…。」私がそう返すと、彼はそのまま去ってった。","title":"シーン 75","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","slideTitle":"第75スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.075.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.30795918367347,"id":"F97095B9-48CA-4332-998B-69875130FDAB","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc301378_一人部屋２（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":4,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_076_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女の部屋から出ると、\n1度深呼吸をして、そのまま共同スペースに降りていく。","title":"シーン 76","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第76スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.076.jpeg","voiceDuration":5.040861678004535,"id":"C53D3CE8-59C6-412A-B6A6-E1067C8CC7A5","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"nc254861_マンションの外廊下（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_077_博麗霊夢.wav","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「どうしたんですか…そんな表情をして。」","title":"シーン 77","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","slideTitle":"第77スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.077.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.405736961451248,"id":"B661DDCC-9FB3-4227-B16A-96C37F31338A","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":4.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_078_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「…何でもないです。」僕は、そう言い、大きく伸びをすると、そのまま窓から外に視線を向ける。","title":"シーン 78","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第78スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.078.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.449546485260771,"id":"DA0FCA74-5D22-46FA-8AC1-7487190D37AD","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_079_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、ある言葉を呟く。\n「今日は、夕陽がいつもより、強く感じますね…」","title":"シーン 79","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第79スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.079.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.254489795918367,"id":"4F15D3AA-1D09-4E94-806C-266FCE8B7C5B","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.2,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_080_操夢.wav","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"私は、彼の言葉にふと、作業の手が止まってしまう。\n「確かに…、そうですね…」私はもどかしくなり、そう返す。","title":"シーン 80","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","slideTitle":"第80スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.080.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.85172335600907,"id":"FCB58D09-9559-47F6-8493-CE3963004E2E","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"咲夜頬照り困った笑み.png"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_081_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「咲夜さん…、あとは僕が作りますから、部屋で休んでて大丈夫ですよ。こっち帰ってきてばっかで疲れるだろうし…」","title":"シーン 81","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第81スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.081.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.019478458049887,"id":"ABB6A41D-FA0A-4E46-AD47-55D0106825E5","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"咲夜頬照り困った笑み.png"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_082_操夢.wav","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「分かりました…、じゃあ、自室で休ませてもらいます。」\n私はそう言うと、作業を切り上げて、階段を上がっていった。","title":"シーン 82","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","slideTitle":"第82スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.082.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.776734693877551,"id":"1DD8A4D0-5877-4E79-AEAC-A961F7BB8D45","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"咲夜頬照り困った笑み.png"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":4.9,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_083_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、一人、共同キッチンで彼女が進めていた料理の続きを進めていく。すると、上から誰かが降りてくる。","title":"シーン 83","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第83スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.083.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.760430839002267,"id":"D4AE9FCC-F034-433A-9086-23E89824F3D0","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.4,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_084_操夢.wav","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「ねぇ、操夢、さっき咲夜と階段ですれ違ったら、気まずそうにしてたけど…、私の決断が影響してるのかしら…」","title":"シーン 84","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","slideTitle":"第84スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.084.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.212607709750567,"id":"B209ABD3-4C83-445B-A917-47617FAE1CFD","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_085_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それは…きっと疲れてるからだと思いますよ…」","title":"シーン 85","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第85スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.085.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.994126984126984,"id":"39DB4262-31BD-4A8E-8114-78D1134A0EC0","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_086_射命丸文.wav","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「そうかしら…」私がそう言っていると、ふと空腹感が湧く。","title":"シーン 86","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","slideTitle":"第86スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.086.jpeg","voiceDuration":3.435578231292517,"id":"5C508D53-8258-4B7A-97F5-B1323BF2F8B9","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_087_ナレーション.wav","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「ねぇ、操夢、あなたの血、飲ませてくれないかしら…」","title":"シーン 87","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","slideTitle":"第87スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.087.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.232018140589569,"id":"EEC4CC1A-D7F3-4B17-AA59-A76B0A952165","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_088_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「いいですよ。」僕はそう言うと、作業を止め、彼女のそばに移動し、彼女に背を向ける。すると、彼女が噛み付く。","title":"シーン 88","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第88スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.088.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.016938775510204,"id":"61D90F87-CCD4-4480-BF7A-C99D522A68A9","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":4.2,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_089_操夢.wav","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「ありがとう、操夢…。私は…、部屋に戻るわ…」\n私はそう言うと、上に上がっていった。","title":"シーン 89","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","slideTitle":"第89スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.089.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.973469387755102,"id":"63726614-DDE9-4B9A-82DB-A3DCED9D2CB5","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":4.9,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_090_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女がいなくなると、少しふらつく足取りを、何とか平常に戻しながら、中断した作業の続きをする。","title":"シーン 90","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第90スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.090.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.227823129251701,"id":"0C94D8DA-DC88-4FB4-B0F3-5B6706AD69DF","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.6,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_091_操夢.wav","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、ふと階段から誰かが降りてくる音がし、\n手を止めて、階段の方を見る。","title":"シーン 91","voiceCharacter":"操夢","slideTitle":"第91スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db\/交換夫婦（28話目）_fc328122db.091.jpeg","voiceDuration":4.027823129251701,"id":"5DE70D82-B4B3-4065-AB03-7E7F6E7B9EF9","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","backgroundName":"リビング（夕方）.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg"},{"transitionName":"なし","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","voiceAudio